OL,3,GNEWSARain returns but parts of Sussex
OL,4,Astill in severe drought
OL,5,
OL,6,FStorm Austen, the first named storm of
OL,7,Fthe season, has brought lashing rain
OL,8,Fand heavy winds to Sussex.
OL,10,FDamage included part of Brighton's
OL,11,Ficonic West Pier collapsing into the
OL,12,Fsea, one side of a petrol station roof
OL,13,Fin Newhaven coming loose, and a tree
OL,14,Ffalling on to a platform at Angmering
OL,15,Fstation.
OL,17,FOver the summer the UK experienced
OL,18,Fmultiple heatwaves and record-breaking
OL,19,Ftemperatures, with parts of the county
OL,20,Fin a "severe drought" following a
OL,21,Fdeclaration made by the government
OL,22,Fearlier this month.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
